{"id":"000W6T","title":"Cracking The Kropki (My Final Puzzle)","author":"Sudokujoker","solvedCount":11,"difficulty":1,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-24T02:16:37+00:00","posted":"Heute, 00:45 Uhr","rules":"The time has come: I've decided to make this my 45th and final puzzle.\n\nI have enjoyed creating puzzles and watching so many people solve them, but I never intended to continue making puzzles indefinitely. I never expected to end up creating as many puzzles as I have, but I feel I have now explored all the concepts that I wanted to.\n\nI want to say \"Thank You\" to everyone who constructs puzzles, and to everyone who solves them - especially Cracking The Cryptic whose videos introduced me to the world of variant sudoku. And special thanks to the Logic Masters Germany website, for providing this platform where anyone can publish their ideas.\n\nThis puzzle brings my puzzle-setting journey full-circle, the fog-filled grid with one visible cell an echo of my first-ever puzzle. During that time I have experimented with many ideas, so if you like this puzzle please check out my other puzzles.\n\nThis puzzle combines Ambiguous Kropki, Standard Fog of War, and German Whispers. Detailed rules are given on the Sudokupad puzzle as always.\n\nSolve on Sudokupad (thank you, Sven!)\n\nFinally, you may notice hidden phrases or words in this puzzle: please could I request that you don't put any \"spoilers\" in the comments.\n\nThank you and happy solving!\n\n~~~~~\n\nIf you would like to give me a gift, please visit\nPayPal.me/SudokuJ. Thank you!","solutionCode":"Row 9","tags":["Sudoku","Kropki","German Whispers (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/9e2wos5vh1","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/9e2wos5vh1","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-24T02:16:37+00